graph TD
    A[AI Candidate Code] --> B{What are we doing?}
    
    B -->|Proving Math is Safe| C[EQY Checker]
    C --> D[Ghost Wrapper Added to Gold]
    D --> E[Math Verified!]
    
    B -->|Measuring Speed & Size| F[PPA Extractor]
    F --> G[OpenSTA / Physical Synthesis]
    G --> H[Massively Improved WNS!]
    
    style E fill:#ccffcc,stroke:#00aa00
    style H fill:#cceeff,stroke:#0088ff
